<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζήτ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is sought</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ ῥάδιον ζ</span>. <i>a
			thing</i> not easy <i>to find</i>, of Pentheus' mutilated limbs,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1139
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσνοούμενον ζ</span>., of God,
				<i><span class="en">
				Secund.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>inquiry, question</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				278
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				15.2
			</span></i>,al.; esp. of a philosophic nature, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ
				περὶ νόμους ζ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				631a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ περὶ φύσεως ζ</span>.
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				891c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιητικῶν ζ. λύσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Metrod.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					831.13
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτ᾽ . . οὗ τυγχάνει
			ζ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				421a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκεῖνό γ᾽ ἦν τὸ ζ. πρῶτον, πότερον .
					.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					221c
				</span></i>
			; <i>search</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα μυρίοις ζητήμασιν εὑρών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1218
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητρός</span>
			<i>after</i> her, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1352
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>official</i> or <i>judicial inquiry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				97.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in pl., <i>claims,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PRyl.
				117.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <i>subjects of dispute</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				785.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				25.19
			</span></i>.</div>
